    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astra Quest: Build. Battle. Dominate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your cosmic war machine and conquer neon-lit chaos in this retro-futuristic shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge the ultimate death machine in <i>Astra Quest</i>, where modular starships collide with synthwave carnage. Combine cores, bases, and devices to craft spacecraft that fight as uniquely as you strategize. Our <strong>Modular Starship System</strong> redefines classic bullet hell gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438820/extras/cc026bf1db6009da88fb05454bccf56b.avif?t=1747947182\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core = Your Soul</strong><br>Defines speed, agility, and unleashes universe-bending ultimate skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base = Your Arsenal</strong><br>Dictates weapon capacity and shields your core from destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devices = Your Edge</strong><br>Mix lasers, plasma drones, energy shields, and more for endless tactical combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438820/extras/7ba0551a6e12d9e9135b28ee3d68ea1c.avif?t=1747947182\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Mode</strong><br>Strategically manage resources to tackle a series of diverse, challenging levels. Plan your builds carefully to overcome unique enemy patterns and epic bosses in this thrilling campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolution Mode</strong><br>Survive relentless, unlimited waves of diverse enemy assaults. Test your skills, rack up high scores, and earn Evolution Points to unlock powerful modules and upgrades in this intense survival challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438820/extras/066ca1bfce12fc4132ec9ee5d0d280ff.avif?t=1747947182\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel your evolution with <strong>Evolution Points</strong> earned in Adventure and Evolution modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock New Content</strong> <br>Spend Evolution Points to access new modules (cores, bases, devices) and expand your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Module Upgrades</strong> <br>Enhance your modules with persistent upgrades, boosting stats like core recharge speed, weapon power, or shield durability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accumulated Advantage</strong> <br>Each run strengthens your Tech Tree, unlocking game-changing starter modules for future battles.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astra Quest: Build. Battle. Dominate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your cosmic war machine and conquer neon-lit chaos in this retro-futuristic shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge the ultimate death machine in <i>Astra Quest</i>, where modular starships collide with synthwave carnage. Combine cores, bases, and devices to craft spacecraft that fight as uniquely as you strategize. Our <strong>Modular Starship System</strong> redefines classic bullet hell gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438820/extras/cc026bf1db6009da88fb05454bccf56b.avif?t=1747947182\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core = Your Soul</strong><br>Defines speed, agility, and unleashes universe-bending ultimate skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base = Your Arsenal</strong><br>Dictates weapon capacity and shields your core from destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devices = Your Edge</strong><br>Mix lasers, plasma drones, energy shields, and more for endless tactical combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438820/extras/7ba0551a6e12d9e9135b28ee3d68ea1c.avif?t=1747947182\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Mode</strong><br>Strategically manage resources to tackle a series of diverse, challenging levels. Plan your builds carefully to overcome unique enemy patterns and epic bosses in this thrilling campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolution Mode</strong><br>Survive relentless, unlimited waves of diverse enemy assaults. Test your skills, rack up high scores, and earn Evolution Points to unlock powerful modules and upgrades in this intense survival challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438820/extras/066ca1bfce12fc4132ec9ee5d0d280ff.avif?t=1747947182\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel your evolution with <strong>Evolution Points</strong> earned in Adventure and Evolution modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock New Content</strong> <br>Spend Evolution Points to access new modules (cores, bases, devices) and expand your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Module Upgrades</strong> <br>Enhance your modules with persistent upgrades, boosting stats like core recharge speed, weapon power, or shield durability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accumulated Advantage</strong> <br>Each run strengthens your Tech Tree, unlocking game-changing starter modules for future battles.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Astra Quest is a retro-futuristic bullet hell shooter. Design modular starships with unique cores, bases, and devices. Survive intense battles, earn Evolution Points, and unlock upgrades in Adventure and Evolution modes to dominate the neon-lit cosmos.",
